# Web

- React 19, Vite, strict TypeScript, alias `@/` → `src/`.
- Pages and product components are named exports. Default export only `App.tsx`.
- Edit `src/components/studio/`. Do not hand-edit generated `src/components/ui/`.
- API types in `src/lib/api/types.ts` match camelCase JSON. Do not recase in JSX.
- Colocate Vitest files (`*.test.ts(x)`). Playwright in `e2e/` mocks the API.
- Prettier: width 140, double quotes, trailing commas, semicolons.
- After UI changes run `npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm run format:check && npm test -- --run` from `apps/web`.
